{"unit_id":"biociao__dsh-science#card-zh","repo":"biociao/dsh-science","commit":"23767ab2f8d7bcf84a0820daa4c6ae79549da000","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-science**（DSH 科研工作台，Web 客户端）：为基因组学与生物信息学研究提供持久化研究循环、结果归档和远程计算。它注册研究、工件和远程主机工具，并提供主机设置页及模型分档路由。主要功能包括跟踪问题与假设、设计实验、记录发现、保存带版本溯源的结果，以及提交和监控 SSH/SLURM 作业。适合需要组织可复查科研流程并使用工作站或集群的研究者。无需额外 API Key；远程计算需要配置 SSH 主机和系统 OpenSSH。","source":"generated","evidence":["engines/research-loop.mjs:299-350","engines/artifact-registry.mjs:78-105","engines/remote-compute.mjs:799-840","cordis.patch.yml:9-40"]}
{"unit_id":"biociao__dsh-science#card-en","repo":"biociao/dsh-science","commit":"23767ab2f8d7bcf84a0820daa4c6ae79549da000","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-science**: Tracks research hypotheses and experiments, archives versioned results with provenance, and manages SSH/SLURM jobs for bioinformatics. It includes remote-host settings and model-tier routing. No API key is required; remote compute needs OpenSSH and SSH configuration.","source":"generated","evidence":["engines/research-loop.mjs:299-350","engines/artifact-registry.mjs:78-105","engines/remote-compute.mjs:799-840","cordis.patch.yml:9-40"]}
